# Produced data never goes to GitHub (decided Oct 26): Tracks A, B and C write their runs, probes,
# replies, caches and checkpoints into these folders; Sol outputs are copied back to
# results/trackA/gpu/. Numbers-only summaries and figures go in results/summaries/ (tracked; see
# tools/export_summaries.py). tools/prepush_check.py refuses a push that would add any of these.
results/trackA/
results/trackB/
results/trackC/
results/voyager_canary.jsonl
results/labels/
results/handoff/
finetune/data/
# GPQA is gated: no GPQA data file is ever tracked
*[Gg][Pp][Qq][Aa]*.json
*[Gg][Pp][Qq][Aa]*.jsonl
*[Gg][Pp][Qq][Aa]*.csv
*[Gg][Pp][Qq][Aa]*.parquet
